1	# Contract: `RecordsBloc` extension (`lib/features/records/presentation/bloc/records_bloc.dart`)
2	
3	Extends RF07's contract (`specs/005-multi-source-timeline/contracts/records-bloc.md`) in place. Still depends
4	only on `EntriesRepository`. Everything below is additive; RF07's own `_onStarted`/`_onNextPageRequested`/
5	`_onPageLoadRetried`(first-load/next-page branch)/`close()` are unchanged except where noted.
6	
7	```dart
8	class RecordsBloc extends Bloc<RecordsEvent, RecordsState> {
9	  RecordsBloc({
10	    required this._entriesRepository,
11	    this._debounceDuration = const Duration(milliseconds: 300),
12	  }) : super(const RecordsLoading()) {
13	    on<RecordsStarted>(_onStarted);
14	    on<NextPageRequested>(_onNextPageRequested);
15	    on<PageLoadRetried>(_onPageLoadRetried);
16	    on<RecordsLocalCacheRefreshed>(_onLocalCacheRefreshed);
17	    on<SearchTextChanged>(_onSearchTextChanged);
18	    on<SearchDebounceElapsed>(_onSearchDebounceElapsed);
19	    on<FilterSheetApplied>(_onFilterSheetApplied);
20	    on<FilterChipRemoved>(_onFilterChipRemoved);
21	    on<FiltersAndSearchCleared>(_onFiltersAndSearchCleared);
22	    on<CriteriaLoadRetried>(_onCriteriaLoadRetried);
23	  }
24	
25	  final EntriesRepository _entriesRepository;
26	  final Duration _debounceDuration;
27	  final _reauthController = StreamController<void>.broadcast();
28	
29	  String _query = '';
30	  DateRangeOption _dateRange = DateRangeOption.allTime;
31	  Set<EntrySource> _entryTypes = {};
32	  Timer? _debounceTimer;
33	  int _fetchGeneration = 0;
34	
35	  Stream<void> get reauthRequired => _reauthController.stream;
36	}
37	```
38	
39	## Search text → debounce → fetch (FR-001/FR-002, research.md R4/R6)
40	
41	```dart
42	Future<void> _onSearchTextChanged(SearchTextChanged event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
43	  _debounceTimer?.cancel();
44	  _query = event.text;
45	  if (event.text.isEmpty) {
46	    // Acceptance Scenario 3 / Edge Case: no request for empty text — refetch immediately under
47	    // whatever filters are still active.
48	    await _fetchForCriteria(emit);
49	    return;
50	  }
51	  _debounceTimer = Timer(
52	    _debounceDuration,
53	    () => add(SearchDebounceElapsed(event.text)),
54	  );
55	}
56	
57	Future<void> _onSearchDebounceElapsed(SearchDebounceElapsed event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
58	  if (event.text != _query) return;   // superseded by a newer keystroke/clear that arrived after the timer fired
59	  await _fetchForCriteria(emit);
60	}
61	```
62	
63	- Deleting the text entirely before 300 ms elapses: `_debounceTimer?.cancel()` on the next
64	  `SearchTextChanged('')` guarantees the pending timer never fires for the abandoned partial text (Edge
65	  Cases).
66	- `_debounceTimer` is cancelled in `close()` too (alongside the existing `_reauthController.close()`).
67	
68	## Filter sheet / chips / clear (FR-003/FR-005/FR-007, research.md R1/R6)
69	
70	```dart
71	Future<void> _onFilterSheetApplied(FilterSheetApplied event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
72	  _dateRange = event.dateRange;
73	  _entryTypes = event.entryTypes;
74	  await _fetchForCriteria(emit);
75	}
76	
77	Future<void> _onFilterChipRemoved(FilterChipRemoved event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
78	  switch (event.chip) {
79	    case DateRangeChip(): _dateRange = DateRangeOption.allTime;
80	    case EntryTypeChip(source: final s): _entryTypes = {..._entryTypes}..remove(s);
81	  }
82	  await _fetchForCriteria(emit);
83	}
84	
85	Future<void> _onFiltersAndSearchCleared(FiltersAndSearchCleared event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
86	  _debounceTimer?.cancel();
87	  _query = '';
88	  _dateRange = DateRangeOption.allTime;
89	  _entryTypes = {};
90	  await _fetchForCriteria(emit);
91	}
92	
93	Future<void> _onCriteriaLoadRetried(CriteriaLoadRetried event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
94	  await _fetchForCriteria(emit);   // re-attempts the exact same last-applied criteria (_query/_dateRange/_entryTypes)
95	}
96	```
